{"book":"psalms","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:14:45.597951656Z","verse":50,"ref":"psalms 78:50","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":78,"translation":"He leveled a path for His anger; He did not spare their nefesh from death, but delivered their life to the pestilence.","tokens":[{"surface":"יפלס","gloss":"He leveled"},{"surface":"נתיב","gloss":"a path"},{"surface":"לאפו","gloss":"for his anger"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"חשך","gloss":"did he spare"},{"surface":"ממות","gloss":"from death"},{"surface":"נפשם","gloss":"their nefesh"},{"surface":"וחיתם","gloss":"and their life"},{"surface":"לדבר","gloss":"to the plague"},{"surface":"הסגיר","gloss":"he delivered up"}]}